1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,623
Context for ten billion: the only K-pop girl group channel ahead of it belongs to BLACKPINK, and that channel needed eight years and one of the most dominant runs in music history to get there.

2
00:00:11,623 --> 00:00:18,041
BABYMONSTER crossed the line in roughly three, on the strength of a catalog of barely thirty songs.

3
00:00:18,041 --> 00:00:25,734
The pace, not the total, is the story — and the pace is what makes the next decade of projections genuinely unstable.

